---
source: src/tui/widgets/viewer_help_tests.rs
expression: "render_text(120, 30, 0)"
---

          ┌ Help ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
          │Moving                                                                                            │
          │  j / ↓         Scroll one line down                                                             ▲│
          │  k / ↑         Scroll one line up                                                               █│
          │  PgDn / Space  Page down                                                                        █│
          │  PgUp          Page up                                                                          █│
          │  Ctrl-D        Half a page down                                                                 █│
          │  Ctrl-U        Half a page up                                                                   █│
          │  g / Home      Jump to the start of the transcript                                              █│
          │  G / End       Jump to the end (where the viewer opens)                                         █│
          │                                                                                                 █│
          │Showing more or less                                                                             █│
          │  t             Cycle tool detail: hidden, summary, truncated, full                              █│
          │  T             Show or hide thinking turns                                                      █│
          │  I             Show or hide aborted and interrupted turns                                       █│
          │  H             Show or hide records the harness's own UI never showed                           █│
          │                                                                                                 █│
          │Finding                                                                                          █│
          │  /             Find in transcript; a match in hidden content turns that content on              █│
          │  n             Next match, wrapping at the end                                                  █│
          │  N             Previous match, wrapping at the start                                            █│
          │                                                                                                 █│
          │Viewer                                                                                           █│
          │  ?             Show or hide this help                                                           ║│
          │  Esc           Step back: close help, then the find, then the viewer                            ▼│
          │  q / Ctrl-C    Leave the viewer at once, even with a find active                                 │
          │j/k/PgDn/PgUp to scroll · Esc/q/? to close                                                        │
          └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
